{"css":"\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@500;900&display=swap');\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{width:1080px;height:1350px;background:#fdf6ec;font-family:'Noto Sans TC','WenQuanYi Zen Hei',sans-serif;color:#1d2a3a;padding:90px 80px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}\n.tag{display:inline-block;align-self:flex-start;background:#1d2a3a;color:#fdf6ec;font-size:34px;font-weight:900;padding:10px 26px;border-radius:40px}\nh1{font-size:150px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:900;margin:60px 0}\nh2{font-size:78px;font-weight:900;margin:36px 0 40px}\n.row{display:flex;gap:30px;margin:20px 0 60px}\n.row svg{width:200px;background:#fff;border-radius:28px;padding:16px}\n.sub{font-size:50px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.5}\n.cover{display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:100%}\n.end{justify-content:center;gap:40px}.end h1{font-size:110px;margin:0}.end .tag{align-self:flex-start}\n.card{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:44px;background:#fff;border-radius:36px;padding:34px 44px;margin-bottom:30px;box-shadow:0 6px 0 #ecdcc4}\n.icon svg{display:block}\nh3{font-size:56px;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:10px}\np{font-size:42px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.4;color:#45546a}\n.end p{color:#1d2a3a}\n.note{margin-top:auto;background:#ffd66b;font-size:44px;font-weight:900;padding:28px 40px;border-radius:30px}\n","slides":["<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"tag\">生活符號翻譯機</div><h1>衣服洗標<br>你看得懂<br>幾個？</h1>\n   <div class=\"row\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"170\"><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M8 30 Q20 22 32 30 T56 30 T80 30 T96 30\"/><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M10 30 L22 86 L78 86 L92 30\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#1d2a3a\" font-family=\"Arial\">30</text></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"170\"><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M50 10 L92 88 L8 88 Z\"/></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"170\"><rect stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"84\" height=\"84\"/><circle stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"32\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"5.5\" fill=\"#1d2a3a\"/></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"170\"><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M10 80 L90 80 L90 50 Q90 30 66 30 L30 30 Q16 30 10 80 Z\"/><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M40 30 Q42 16 64 16 L80 16\"/><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"58\" r=\"5.5\" fill=\"#1d2a3a\"/><circle cx=\"62\" cy=\"58\" r=\"5.5\" fill=\"#1d2a3a\"/></svg></div><p class=\"sub\">洗壞衣服之前，先收藏這篇 👉</p></div>","<div class=\"tag\">01 水洗</div><h2>🪣 水桶 = 可以水洗</h2><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"170\"><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M8 30 Q20 22 32 30 T56 30 T80 30 T96 30\"/><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M10 30 L22 86 L78 86 L92 30\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#1d2a3a\" font-family=\"Arial\">30</text></svg></div><div><h3>數字 = 最高水溫</h3><p>30 代表水溫不要超過 30°C</p></div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"170\"><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M8 30 Q20 22 32 30 T56 30 T80 30 T96 30\"/><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M10 30 L22 86 L78 86 L92 30\"/><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"5\" d=\"M40 72 L40 50 M48 72 L48 44 M56 72 L56 46 M64 72 L64 54 M40 72 Q52 80 64 72\"/></svg></div><div><h3>水桶裡有手</h3><p>只能手洗，不要丟洗衣機</p></div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"170\"><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M8 30 Q20 22 32 30 T56 30 T80 30 T96 30\"/><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M10 30 L22 86 L78 86 L92 30\"/><path stroke=\"#e5484d\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" d=\"M10 10 L90 90 M90 10 L10 90\"/></svg></div><div><h3>水桶打叉</h3><p>不可水洗，通常要送乾洗</p></div></div>","<div class=\"tag\">02 漂白</div><h2>🔺 三角形 = 漂白</h2><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"170\"><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M50 10 L92 88 L8 88 Z\"/></svg></div><div><h3>空白三角形</h3><p>任何漂白劑都可以</p></div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"170\"><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M50 10 L92 88 L8 88 Z\"/><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M38 76 L56 36 M52 76 L70 36\"/></svg></div><div><h3>裡面有兩條斜線</h3><p>只能用含氧漂白劑</p></div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"170\"><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M50 10 L92 88 L8 88 Z\"/><path stroke=\"#e5484d\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" d=\"M10 10 L90 90 M90 10 L10 90\"/></svg></div><div><h3>三角形打叉</h3><p>不可漂白</p></div></div>","<div class=\"tag\">03 烘乾</div><h2>⬜ 方框＋圓圈 = 烘乾機</h2><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"170\"><rect stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"84\" height=\"84\"/><circle stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"32\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"5.5\" fill=\"#1d2a3a\"/></svg></div><div><h3>1 個點</h3><p>低溫烘乾</p></div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"170\"><rect stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"84\" height=\"84\"/><circle stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"32\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"50\" r=\"5.5\" fill=\"#1d2a3a\"/><circle cx=\"58\" cy=\"50\" r=\"5.5\" fill=\"#1d2a3a\"/></svg></div><div><h3>2 個點</h3><p>一般溫度烘乾</p></div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"170\"><rect stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"84\" height=\"84\"/><circle stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"32\"/><path stroke=\"#e5484d\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" d=\"M10 10 L90 90 M90 10 L10 90\"/></svg></div><div><h3>打叉</h3><p>不可用烘衣機</p></div></div><div class=\"note\">點越多 = 可以用的溫度越高</div>","<div class=\"tag\">04 熨燙</div><h2>🔥 熨斗 = 可以燙</h2><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"170\"><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M10 80 L90 80 L90 50 Q90 30 66 30 L30 30 Q16 30 10 80 Z\"/><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M40 30 Q42 16 64 16 L80 16\"/><circle cx=\"54\" cy=\"58\" r=\"5.5\" fill=\"#1d2a3a\"/></svg></div><div><h3>1 個點</h3><p>低溫，約 110°C</p></div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"170\"><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M10 80 L90 80 L90 50 Q90 30 66 30 L30 30 Q16 30 10 80 Z\"/><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M40 30 Q42 16 64 16 L80 16\"/><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"58\" r=\"5.5\" fill=\"#1d2a3a\"/><circle cx=\"62\" cy=\"58\" r=\"5.5\" fill=\"#1d2a3a\"/></svg></div><div><h3>2 個點</h3><p>中溫，約 150°C</p></div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"170\"><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M10 80 L90 80 L90 50 Q90 30 66 30 L30 30 Q16 30 10 80 Z\"/><path stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M40 30 Q42 16 64 16 L80 16\"/><circle cx=\"38\" cy=\"58\" r=\"5.5\" fill=\"#1d2a3a\"/><circle cx=\"54\" cy=\"58\" r=\"5.5\" fill=\"#1d2a3a\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"58\" r=\"5.5\" fill=\"#1d2a3a\"/></svg></div><div><h3>3 個點</h3><p>高溫，約 200°C</p></div></div>","<div class=\"tag\">05 乾洗</div><h2>⭕ 圓圈 = 乾洗</h2><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"170\"><circle stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"40\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"44\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#1d2a3a\" font-family=\"Arial\">P</text></svg></div><div><h3>圓圈裡有字母</h3><p>P、F 是給乾洗店看的溶劑種類</p></div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"170\"><circle stroke=\"#1d2a3a\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"40\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"44\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#1d2a3a\" font-family=\"Arial\"></text><path stroke=\"#e5484d\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" d=\"M10 10 L90 90 M90 10 L10 90\"/></svg></div><div><h3>圓圈打叉</h3><p>不可乾洗</p></div></div><div class=\"note\">記住口訣：看到 ✕ 就是「不可以」</div>","<div class=\"cover end\"><h1>🔖 收藏起來<br>洗衣服前翻一下</h1><p class=\"sub\">還有哪個符號看不懂？<br>留言告訴我，下一篇幫你解密 👇</p><div class=\"tag\">追蹤 @fuhao.decoded 看懂每個符號</div></div>"]}